mom-inst (0.2.17-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add --no-recommends flag: passes --no-install-recommends to apt-get
    and --no-deps to dnf for minimal dependency installs.
  * Expand deny list: add sandbox-escape (FUSE mounts, VPN/tunnel tools),
    kernel module manipulation, and additional recon/attack packages
    per security review recommendations.

 -- Dirk Petersen <dirk@petersen.dev>  Wed, 15 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000

mom-inst (0.2.16-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Security-hardened setuid binary for non-root package installation.
  * Supports apt-get (Debian/Ubuntu) and dnf (RHEL).
  * Package deny list with glob pattern support.
  * JSON audit logging and syslog integration.

 -- Dirk Petersen <dirk@petersen.dev>  Mon, 14 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
